{"unit_id": "tag:0EUC:proof", "translation": "令<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。须证明基变换（base changes）<MATH_0002>形成有效（effective）满态射（epimorphism）。为此，假设给定概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>以及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>，在<MATH_0006>上有<MATH_0005>。选取仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>。令<MATH_0008>为<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>中的逆（inverse）像（image）。于是<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>沿<MATH_0013>的基变换（base change）。因此由假设，限制（restrictions）族<MATH_0014>来自概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>。这些态射在交叠处（overlaps）一致并定义所需态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>的证明留给读者。参见《概形（Schemes）》一章第<REF_0001>节的讨论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base changes", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "overlaps", "target_term": "交叠处"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "概形术语待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "态射术语待决。"}, {"source_term": "base changes", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "基变换待决。"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效", "context": "满态射有效性待决。"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射", "context": "满态射术语待决。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "概形术语待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "t